The Switch:

Interfaces Fast Ethernet 05 to 24 are shutdown. This prevents unnecessary doors from being open to attack by 
limiting unauthorised network connections.

VLAN MANAGEMENT

End devices are split into VLAN 10 and VLAN 20. This prevents end devices between the VLANs from communicating.

PC 1 - 192.168.10.11
PC 2 - 192.168.10.12
Laptop 1 - 192.168.20.11
Laptop 2 - 192.168.20.12

The PCs can communicate with each other. Likewise, the Laptops can communicate with each other. But a PC cant successfully
ping to laptop 1 as the resources are controlled i.e. a printer in vlan 10 can only be accessed by PCs in vlan 10.





